  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now, if I have a home world for my group that has 'bedrooms' for each member, everyone still spawns in at the default spawn. I think it would be nice to be able to set spawnpoints based on user_id, that way each person can spawn in their own designated room.\n\nOr, as another example of this, a public world with secret areas. Only those who've been set to spawn in those secret areas could do so, while all others spawn at the default spawn. ",
